source.inspectionDescription:
Reports 'continue' statements if they are the last reachable statements in the loop. These 'continue' statements are unnecessary and can be safely removed. Example: 'for (String element: elements) {
    System.out.println();
    continue;
  }' After the quick-fix is applied: 'for (String element: elements) {
    System.out.println();
  }' Inspection ID: UnnecessaryContinue

